  <p>The service maps set the journey; the sitemap set the structure. Every page of the eventual site, mapped before it existed.</p>
  <figure class="wmed"><img src="/assets/img/hems/sitemap.jpg" alt="Basic sitemap — the full site page tree" style="width:100%;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--hair);display:block" loading="lazy" />
