  <h2>The sales guide: seven versions to get it right</h2>
  <p>The sales guide started as an opportunity I spotted, not a request: the sales team needed the same journey the site was built on, in a form they could use in conversation. I produced it and remained its primary point of contact throughout the project — and it was adopted across the entire GME sales organization, evolving through seven versions between April 2024 and December 2025 as consultant feedback reshaped it from a graphics-heavy 48-page deck into a step-by-step 35-page guide.</p>
